refused: d232_use_a_limb_language.cy:4:1, line 4 column 1
 4 | use inline.@llvm::ir as ir;
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  ``
 why:  `use` only shortens a path with `::` into a kit or limb, so a base family like `inline.…` or `union.…` stays written in full, a limb's members included (D232, D399)
